{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261013%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 1000　1庭　上訴庭法官彭偉昌及楊家雄、法官譚耀豪<br/>被指私了咬耳陳真　男生認罪判囚4年半｜不服刑罰逾期上訴</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審<br/>► 1430　27庭　法官高勁修<br/>41歲男警涉多次未經授權取用警方系統資料及淋紅油｜再提訊<br/>藝人蔚雨芯涉詐騙旗下美容中心股東｜再提訊</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　6庭　暫委裁判官吳思思<br/>網媒Channel C涉拖欠薪金逾16萬元　公司管理層被票控5罪｜開審<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>元朗村屋破獲逾700萬元毒品　歌手羅啟聰與兩人被控販毒及製毒｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>涉非禮未成年女員工　旺角女僕Cafe負責人遭控兩罪｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T13:59:06.634636+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":468,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:40:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T16:37:49.729944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:57:42.366797+00:00","content_hash":"3b5767dc8372081a5e718254851eb7b5309e750c0752212316cce26d864c15d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}